_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-056-jiang-dun-ws1557685"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun:source_review1-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"bwx_yj3_fl0","source_quote":"惇字思悛，孝友淳粹，高節邁俗。性好學，儒玄並綜。每以為君子立行，應依禮而動，雖隱顯殊途，未有不傍禮教者也。若乃放達不羈，以肆縱為貴者，非但動違禮法，亦道之所棄也。乃著《通道崇檢論》，世咸稱之。蘇峻之亂，避地東陽山，太尉郗鑒檄為兗州治中，又辟太尉掾；康帝為司徒，亦辟焉；征西將軍庾亮請為儒林參軍；徵拜博士、著作郎，皆不就。邑裏宗其道，有事必諮而後行。東陽太守阮裕、長山令王濛，皆一時名士，並與惇遊處，深相欽重。養志二十餘年，永和九年卒，時年四十九，友朋相與刊石立頌，以表德美雲。","reading":"江惇字思悛，屢辟皆辭。阮裕、王濛與之遊處，永和九年卒，年四十九。","note":"江惇字思悛，屢辟皆辭。阮裕、王濛與之遊處，永和九年卒，年四十九。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun:p001","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":238,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun","source_id":"s-jinshu-056-jiang-dun-ws1557685"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin056-volume-jiang-dun-father","subject_person_id":"bwx_yj3_fl0","object_person_id":"z8m_9y0_s2w","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"二子：虨、惇"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-056","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-tong","source_id":"s-jinshu-056-jiang-tong-ws1557685","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-tong:p021","quote":"後為博士、尚書郎，參大司馬、齊王冏軍事。冏驕荒將敗，統切諫，文多不載。遷廷尉正，每州郡疑獄，斷處從輕。成都王穎請為記室，多所箴諫。申論陸雲兄弟，辭甚切至。以母憂去職。服闋，為司徒左長史。東海王越為兗州牧，以統為別駕，委以州事，與統書曰：「昔王子師為豫州，未下車，辟荀慈明；下車，辟孔文舉。貴州人士有堪應此者不？」統舉高平郗鑒為賢良，陳留阮修為直言，濟北程收為方正，時以為知人。尋遷黃門侍郎、散騎常侍，領國子博士。永嘉四年，避難奔于成皋，病卒。凡所造賦頌表奏皆傳於後。二子：虨、惇。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-tong:p021:m0238","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-tong:p021:m0103"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"江統傳末具二子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-jin056-volume-jiang-dun-death","person_id":"bwx_yj3_fl0","event_type":"death","source_term":"卒","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun:p001","start":215,"end":216,"surface":"卒"},"date_expression":"永和九年","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-056","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun","source_id":"s-jinshu-056-jiang-dun-ws1557685","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun:p001","quote":"惇字思悛，孝友淳粹，高節邁俗。性好學，儒玄並綜。每以為君子立行，應依禮而動，雖隱顯殊途，未有不傍禮教者也。若乃放達不羈，以肆縱為貴者，非但動違禮法，亦道之所棄也。乃著《通道崇檢論》，世咸稱之。蘇峻之亂，避地東陽山，太尉郗鑒檄為兗州治中，又辟太尉掾；康帝為司徒，亦辟焉；征西將軍庾亮請為儒林參軍；徵拜博士、著作郎，皆不就。邑裏宗其道，有事必諮而後行。東陽太守阮裕、長山令王濛，皆一時名士，並與惇遊處，深相欽重。養志二十餘年，永和九年卒，時年四十九，友朋相與刊石立頌，以表德美雲。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun:p001:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-056-appraisal:p001:m0104","surface":"惇","start":104,"end":105,"person_id":"bwx_yj3_fl0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-056-appraisal:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-056-appraisal"},{"id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun:p001:m0000","surface":"惇","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"bwx_yj3_fl0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun"},{"id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun:p001:m0002","surface":"思悛","start":2,"end":4,"person_id":"bwx_yj3_fl0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun"},{"id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun:p001:m0195","surface":"惇","start":195,"end":196,"person_id":"bwx_yj3_fl0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-dun"},{"id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-tong:p021:m0238","surface":"惇","start":238,"end":239,"person_id":"bwx_yj3_fl0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-tong:p021","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-tong"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin056-volume-jiang-dun-father","subject_person_id":"bwx_yj3_fl0","object_person_id":"z8m_9y0_s2w","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"二子：虨、惇"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-056","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-tong","source_id":"s-jinshu-056-jiang-tong-ws1557685","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-tong:p021","quote":"後為博士、尚書郎，參大司馬、齊王冏軍事。冏驕荒將敗，統切諫，文多不載。遷廷尉正，每州郡疑獄，斷處從輕。成都王穎請為記室，多所箴諫。申論陸雲兄弟，辭甚切至。以母憂去職。服闋，為司徒左長史。東海王越為兗州牧，以統為別駕，委以州事，與統書曰：「昔王子師為豫州，未下車，辟荀慈明；下車，辟孔文舉。貴州人士有堪應此者不？」統舉高平郗鑒為賢良，陳留阮修為直言，濟北程收為方正，時以為知人。尋遷黃門侍郎、散騎常侍，領國子博士。永嘉四年，避難奔于成皋，病卒。凡所造賦頌表奏皆傳於後。二子：虨、惇。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-tong:p021:m0238","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-056-jiang-tong:p021:m0103"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"江統傳末具二子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-056-appraisal:p001","text":"史臣曰：江統風檢操行，良有可稱，陳留多士，斯為其冠。《徙戎》之論，實乃經國遠圖。然運距中衰，陵替有漸，假其言見用，恐速禍招怨，無救於將顛也。逮湣懷廢徙，冒禁拜辭，所謂命輕鴻毛，義貴熊掌。虨位隆端石，竭誠獻替。惇遺忽榮利，聿修天爵。雖出處異途，俱難兄弟矣。孫楚體英絢之姿，超然出類，見知武子，誠無愧色。覽其貽皓之書，諒曩代之佳筆也。而負才誕傲，蔑苞忿奕，違遜讓之道，肆陵憤之氣，丁年沈廢，諒自取矣。統、綽棣華秀髮，名顯中興，可謂無忝爾祖。統竟淪跡下邑，窮觀勝地，會其心焉。綽獻直論辭，都不懾元子，有匪躬之節，豈徒文雅而已哉！","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":106,"last_line":106,"raw_start":9954,"raw_end":10217,"raw_character_offsets":[9956,9957,9958,9959,9960,9961,9